{"ID":"20230926154717-oq8fuut","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926154717-oq8fuut","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926154717-oq8fuut\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926154720-a4im5rh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926154720-4q1nhuz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926154720-4q1nhuz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:22,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:22\u0026#125;","title":"【橘皮竹茹汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926154720"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926154720-a4im5rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926154720-a4im5rh","updated":"20230926154720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：橘皮二升、竹茹二升、大枣三十枚、生姜半斤、甘草五两、人参一两"}]},{"ID":"20230926154720-nq8h7q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926154720-nq8h7q8","updated":"20230926154720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右六味，以水一斗，煮取三升，温服一升，日三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926154720-4q1nhuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926154720-4q1nhuz","updated":"20230926154720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【金匮/17-23】哕逆者，橘皮竹茹汤主之。"}]}]}